{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは〜〜＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも応援ありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Mステ見てくださった皆さん\nありがとう(*´ｰ`*人)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はーーー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんだか小説が読みたい気分になったので\n読んで精神統一します。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"タイトルはまだ内緒ですみません。\n拝読し終えたら書きます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうそう、\n秋といえば紅葉なのにMステの装飾を\n見るまで忘れてました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"近年の、秋＝ハロウィン\nという風潮がそうさせたのでしょうか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それとも単に自然に触れてないだけかなぁ..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"外でまったりしたいな(*´-`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか元気なさそうな\n文章になりましたが、\n全然元気です！！！すみません！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はしくじり先生の収録でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じつは昨日"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"若林さんにガチの説教をされる夢を\n見てしまったので、\n謎の怯えを抱えつつ\n収録に臨みました。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"正夢にならなくてよかった(∩´﹏`∩)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も大変素晴らしい授業を\nありがとうございました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"OAをお楽しみに〜〜\\( ˆoˆ )/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":".｡.:✽・ﾟ＋.｡.:✽・ﾟ＋.｡.:✽・ﾟ＋.｡.:✽・ﾟ＋."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先日"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kazumi.takayama/img/blog/kazumi.takayama/img/2016/11/05/5042529/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好きなリトグリちゃんから\nいただいちゃいましたよ(*´ｰ`*人)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しか嬉しか〜〜(´;ω;`)♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日テレハロウィン、\nリトグリちゃんと同じ日で幸せでした♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アリーナの端っこで\n一緒に盛り上がっちゃった♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新曲もいい歌〜〜\\( ˆoˆ )/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"武道館、ぜひ行きたいなぁ...！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これはその日テレハロウィンの写真たち。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kazumi.takayama/img/blog/kazumi.takayama/img/2016/11/05/5042529/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このいくちゃんヽ(´>∀<`*)ﾉ\n愛くるしい！\n天使が悪魔に悪戯しました〜〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、衣装がってことだよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kazumi.takayama/img/blog/kazumi.takayama/img/2016/11/05/5042529/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ま、り、か＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うちらがよく話すことはファンの人には\nまだ知られていないのだろうか..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"万理華にちょっかいを出すのが好きで、\n万理華もまた私の名をよく呼んできます。\n楽しいです。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":".｡.:✽・ﾟ＋.｡.:✽・ﾟ＋.｡.:✽・ﾟ＋.｡.:✽・ﾟ＋."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして明日！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"19時54分から、テレ東さんにて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「ふるさとプレゼン旅\nニッポン！そこどこ観光大使」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"が放送になります！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"南房総を案内させていただきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木中でおなじみの場所はもちろん、\n新たな海鮮のお店も紹介してますので、\nぜひチェックしてみてください♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"同じく明日は\n名古屋で握手会でーす\\( ˆoˆ )/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみに待ってまーす！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では！今日はこの辺で♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kazumi.takayama/img/blog/kazumi.takayama/img/2016/11/05/5042529/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kazumi.takayama/img/blog/kazumi.takayama/img/2016/11/05/5042529/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後にかずやでさよなら〜〜\\(^3^)/"}],"source":"archive"}